   "html": "<section class=\"block card xpulse-card\"><h2>X analyst pulse <span class=\"tag\">X · Oct 24</span></h2><div class=\"xp-verdict neg\"><div class=\"xp-verdict-main\"><span class=\"xp-verdict-lbl\">Crowd read</span><span class=\"xp-verdict-txt\">Analysts lean <strong>defensive</strong></span></div><div class=\"xp-verdict-meta\"><span class=\"xp-count pos\">1 bullish</span><span class=\"xp-count warn\">1 neutral</span><span class=\"xp-count neg\">4 bearish</span><span class=\"src-chip diverge\">Diverges with our Cautious regime</span></div></div><ul class=\"xp-list\"><li class=\"xp-item\"><a class=\"xp-thumb\" href=\"https://x.com/glassnode/status/2113643054695342256\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chart posted by @glassnode\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/x/2113643054695342256.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"xp-body\"><div class=\"xp-chips\"><span class=\"xp-sig neg\">Bearish</span><span class=\"xp-topic\">derivatives</span></div><p class=\"xp-take\">Speculative money rotated into stock perps during the bear phase, with TradFi perps on Hyperliquid hitting over 3x bitcoin perp volume in August.</p><div class=\"xp-src\"><a href=\"https://x.com/glassnode/status/2113643054695342256\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@glassnode</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Oct 23</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/glassnode/status/2113643054695342256\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li><li class=\"xp-item\"><a class=\"xp-thumb\" href=\"https://x.com/ecoinometrics/status/2113625177078772157\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chart posted by @ecoinometrics\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/x/2113625177078772157.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"xp-body\"><div class=\"xp-chips\"><span class=\"xp-sig neg\">Bearish</span><span class=\"xp-topic\">macro</span></div><p class=\"xp-take\">The 10Y yield eased from about 5.3% to just above 5%.</p><div class=\"xp-src\"><a href=\"https://x.com/ecoinometrics/status/2113625177078772157\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@ecoinometrics</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Oct 23</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/ecoinometrics/status/2113625177078772157\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li><li class=\"xp-item\"><a class=\"xp-thumb\" href=\"https://x.com/AxelAdlerJr/status/2113556823110533483\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chart posted by @AxelAdlerJr\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/x/2113556823110533483.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"xp-body\"><div class=\"xp-chips\"><span class=\"xp-sig warn\">Neutral</span><span class=\"xp-topic\">on-chain</span></div><p class=\"xp-take\">Coins keep leaving exchanges while futures positioning sits near neutral, so neither side has control yet.</p><div class=\"xp-src\"><a href=\"https://x.com/AxelAdlerJr/status/2113556823110533483\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@AxelAdlerJr</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Oct 23</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/AxelAdlerJr/status/2113556823110533483\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li><li class=\"xp-item\"><a class=\"xp-thumb\" href=\"https://x.com/Darkfost_Coc/status/2113510478156529816\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chart posted by @Darkfost_Coc\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/x/2113510478156529816.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"xp-body\"><div class=\"xp-chips\"><span class=\"xp-sig neg\">Bearish</span><span class=\"xp-topic\">macro</span></div><p class=\"xp-take\">Brent holding above $100 keeps inflation sticky and squeezes the fresh liquidity that risk assets like bitcoin need.</p><div class=\"xp-src\"><a href=\"https://x.com/Darkfost_Coc/status/2113510478156529816\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@Darkfost_Coc</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Oct 23</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/Darkfost_Coc/status/2113510478156529816\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li><li class=\"xp-item\"><a class=\"xp-thumb\" href=\"https://x.com/AxelAdlerJr/status/2112882363730637247\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chart posted by @AxelAdlerJr\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/x/2112882363730637247.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"xp-body\"><div class=\"xp-chips\"><span class=\"xp-sig pos\">Bullish</span><span class=\"xp-topic\">on-chain</span></div><p class=\"xp-take\">Supply in profit recovered to 14.11 million BTC from below 11 million, just under the 14.19 million accumulation threshold.</p><div class=\"xp-src\"><a href=\"https://x.com/AxelAdlerJr/status/2112882363730637247\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@AxelAdlerJr</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Oct 21</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/AxelAdlerJr/status/2112882363730637247\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li><li class=\"xp-item\"><a class=\"xp-thumb\" href=\"https://x.com/velo_xyz/status/2112643449208078479\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chart posted by @velo_xyz\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/x/2112643449208078479.jpg\"/></a><div class=\"xp-body\"><div class=\"xp-chips\"><span class=\"xp-sig neg\">Bearish</span><span class=\"xp-topic\">flows</span></div><p class=\"xp-take\">The Coinbase premium is the most negative since the early July bottom, a sign of soft US spot demand.</p><div class=\"xp-src\"><a href=\"https://x.com/velo_xyz/status/2112643449208078479\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@velo_xyz</a><span class=\"xp-date\">Oct 20</span><a class=\"xp-open\" href=\"https://x.com/velo_xyz/status/2112643449208078479\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">View post ↗</a></div></div></li></ul><p class=\"xp-note\">Curated data-first analysts only · paraphrased, not advice</p></section>"
